    "- **Maximum length:** 149 words\n",
    "- **95th percentile:** 80 words\n",
    "- **99th percentile:** 98 words\n",
    "\n",
    "Based on this distribution, a maximum sequence length of **128** was selected for the BiLSTM. This covers the 99th percentile of the training samples while providing additional room for longer sequences, without using the maximum observed length of 149 for every sample."
