    "# Common Model Evaluation\n",
    "\n",
    "To ensure a fair comparison across models with different internal architectures,\n",
    "all models are evaluated at the final MCQ level.\n",
    "\n",
    "The highest-ranked option is treated as the Top-1 prediction, and common\n",
    "multiclass metrics are calculated across the five answer classes (A-E)."
